            </t>
            <t index="139" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:28,724</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:31,120</end-time>
                <translation>我自己有时也会感觉到这一点</translation>
                <original>自分でもちょっと感じることがあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="140" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:31,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:33,700</end-time>
                <translation>世道在相当程度上趋于简单化</translation>
                <original>世の中が割と単純化していく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="141" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:33,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:36,620</end-time>
                <translation>这一点我是有感觉的</translation>
                <original>ということは感じてはいますね</original>
