            <t index="146" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:56,455</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,800</end-time>
                <translation>为了让手划的小船笔直前进</translation>
                <original>手漕ぎのボートをまっすぐに進ませるためには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="147" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:08:59,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,125</end-time>
