            </t>
            <t index="153" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:22,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:27,250</end-time>
                <translation>我们是倒退着进入未来的</translation>
                <original>我々は未来に後戻りして進んでいく</original>
