            </t>
            <t index="226" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:50,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:55,325</end-time>
                <translation>感觉那件事现在终于来到了我心里</translation>
                <original>なんかそれが今僕の中にやっときた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="227" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:55,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:59,175</end-time>
                <translation>和扫墓热潮的话题也有点接近</translation>
                <original>お墓参りブームの話にもちょっと近くて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="228" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:59,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:03,300</end-time>
                <translation>我虽然不说死后的世界和灵魂 并不相信</translation>
