            <t index="301" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:02,710</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:05,400</end-time>
                <translation>民主主义正如我刚才所说</translation>
                <original>それは民主主義っていうのは今申し上げたように</original>
